# Ionic conductivity: strong vs weak electrolytes
register lv2
new
new
# Strong electrolyte: NaCl fully dissociates
add v1 water 200mL
add v1 NaCl 5.8g
measure v1 conductivity
measure v1 ph
# Weak electrolyte: acetic acid partially dissociates
add v2 water 200mL
add v2 CH3COOH 6g
measure v2 conductivity
measure v2 ph
inspect v1
inspect v2
